      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我知道而且与她有关，\n加上能联想到“大树”的地方，\n就只有这里了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc60b8aa0cbf0db7827bd1944da3451363ebf1b3fd9987ebc3a624d60d39e184",
